{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18577","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吐谷浑盛强，背西海以夸。\n岁侵扰我疆，退匿险且遐。\n帝谓神武师。\n往征靖皇家。\n烈烈斾其旗，熊虎杂龙蛇。\n王旅千万人，衔枚默无譁。\n束刃踰山徼，张翼纵漠沙。\n一举刈羶腥，尸骸积如麻。\n除恶务本根，况敢遗萌芽。\n洋洋西海水，威命穷天涯。\n系虏来王都，犒乐穷休嘉。\n登高望还师，竟野如春华。\n行者靡不归，亲戚劝要遮。\n凯旋献清庙，万国思无邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}